    {
      "source": "Redis specific <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/keyvalue/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/keyvalue/core/KeyValueAdapter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>KeyValueAdapter</code></a> implementation. Uses binary codec to read/write data from/to Redis. Objects\nare stored in a Redis Hash using the value of <a href=\"RedisHash.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.redis.core\"><code>RedisHash</code></a>, the <a href=\"convert/KeyspaceConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core.convert\"><code>KeyspaceConfiguration</code></a> or just\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html#getName()\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Class.getName()</code></a> as a prefix. <br/>\n<strong>Example</strong>\n\n<pre><code>\n@RedisHash(\"persons\")\nclass Person {\n  @Id String id;\n  String name;\n}\n\n\n        prefix              ID\n          |                 |\n          V                 V\nhgetall persons:5d67b7e1-8640-4475-beeb-c666fab4c0e5\n1) id\n2) 5d67b7e1-8640-4475-beeb-c666fab4c0e5\n3) name\n4) Rand al'Thor\n</code>\n</pre>\n\n<br/>\nThe <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/keyvalue/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/keyvalue/core/KeyValueAdapter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>KeyValueAdapter</code></a> is <strong>not</strong> intended to store simple types such as <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> values.\nPlease use <a href=\"RedisTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core\"><code>RedisTemplate</code></a> for this purpose.",
      "translation": "针对 Redis 的特定<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/keyvalue/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/keyvalue/core/KeyValueAdapter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>KeyValueAdapter</code></a>实现。使用二进制编解码器从 Redis 读取和写入数据。对象存储在 Redis Hash 中，前缀为<a href=\"RedisHash.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.redis.core\"><code>RedisHash</code></a>的值、<a href=\"convert/KeyspaceConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core.convert\"><code>KeyspaceConfiguration</code></a>或简单的\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html#getName()\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Class.getName()</code></a>。<br/>\n<strong>示例</strong>\n\n<pre><code>\n@RedisHash(\"persons\")\nclass Person {\n  @Id String id;\n  String name;\n}\n\n\n        prefix              ID\n          |                 |\n          V                 V\nhgetall persons:5d67b7e1-8640-4475-beeb-c666fab4c0e5\n1) id\n2) 5d67b7e1-8640-4475-beeb-c666fab4c0e5\n3) name\n4) Rand al'Thor\n</code>\n</pre>\n\n<br/>\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/keyvalue/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/keyvalue/core/KeyValueAdapter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>KeyValueAdapter</code></a> <strong>不</strong>旨在存储简单类型（如<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a>值）。请使用<a href=\"RedisTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core\"><code>RedisTemplate</code></a>实现此目的。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Configure a <a href=\"../listener/RedisMessageListenerContainer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.listener\"><code>RedisMessageListenerContainer</code></a> to listen for Keyspace expiry events. The container can only be\nset when this bean hasn't been yet <a href=\"#afterPropertiesSet()\"><code>initialized</code></a>.",
      "translation": "配置一个<a href=\"../listener/RedisMessageListenerContainer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.listener\"><code>RedisMessageListenerContainer</code></a>以监听键空间过期事件。该容器只能在尚未初始化此 Bean 时进行设置。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Configuration flag controlling storage of phantom keys (shadow copies) of expiring entities to read them later when\npublishing <a href=\"RedisKeyspaceEvent.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core\"><code>RedisKeyspaceEvent</code></a>.",
      "translation": "控制是否将即将过期的实体（幽灵键/影子副本）存储到磁盘以便在发布<a href=\"RedisKeyspaceEvent.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core\"><code>RedisKeyspaceEvent</code></a>时读取的配置文件标志。",
      "count": 1
